cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VSON in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "Visual Scene Ontology Notation (VSON)"
abstract: >-
  An OWL/SHACL ontology plus two authoring surfaces (Penman-style VSON-P and
  the compact sigil syntax VSON-X) for representing visual scenes as typed,
  validatable graphs.
type: software
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-07-31
repository-code: "https://github.com/yamancan/visual-scene-ontology"
